{"id":"infeliz","lemma":"infeliz","pos":"adj","rank":2608,"glosses":["unhappy","unfortunate"],"ipa":"/infeˈliθ/","forms":{"femininePlural":"infelices"},"order":2616,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/77/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-infeliz.wav","examples":[{"text":"Los pobres no siempre son infelices.","en":"The poor are not always unhappy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/788357","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"poor","l":"pobre"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Yo no era infeliz.","en":"I wasn't unhappy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442824","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Él vivió una vida infeliz.","en":"He lived an unhappy life.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to live","l":"vivir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"life"},null]}]}